{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tower Defense meets Cursor Clicker gameplay.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you defend your castle both with its own abilities and by using your cursor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick runs of 15 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss fight after 15 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puchase skills without any limits as long as you have coins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 types of castles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each castle has its own purchasable skills and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent upgrade system to become stronger and beat enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode for limitless fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique enemies and bosses for different stages.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Castle And Cursor</strong> is fast paced tower defense and bullet hell game focuses on rapidly upgrades and quick gameplay.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You collect coins as you defeat enemies and puchase new skills to upgrade both your tower and your cursor. Game enables multiple playing styles. You can both upgrade more on your castle or your cursor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game currently has 5 available castles each has its own unique abilities. You can also select diffuculty level to challenge yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to break the game!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3954340?t=1757931812","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3954340?t=1757931812","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steam